# Declare Independence, answer "Never!" at the @DECLARE confirm. Fixture: France 1599 (map_found_colony input.sav) with every French colony's
# rebel_dividend set to 60% of its rebel_divisor, so the SoL is 59% (>= the 50% gate). GAME menu row "DECLARE INDEPENDENCE" (logical y 85)
# opens the Never/Yes confirm (rows: Never! y 150, Yes! y 162); Never! (click, then keyboard route) and a re-open each leave the save unchanged.
click 22 3               # GAME menu
click 50 85              # DECLARE INDEPENDENCE: "Shall we declare our independence from France..." Never / Yes
wait 10
shot
click 150 150            # Never!
wait 10
click 22 3               # GAME menu again
click 50 85              # confirm again
wait 10
key Return               # Enter takes the first row (Never!)
wait 10
